WEBVTT

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.900
Ma-chan, hurry up and eat breakfast.

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:41.100
O-Okay, I'm coming.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>The flowers are blooming.</i>

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.560
<i>Buds are appearing on the cherry trees.</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:48.110
<i>Spring will be here soon.</i>

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:51.160
Let's see...

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:54.150
"Graduating students...

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:57.990
Congratulations on graduating.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:00.390
Those of us who remain 
will continue to pass...

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:05.130
through these school gates, 
still not even knowing our way..."

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:06.490
Ka-na-mecchi!

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:11.380
Honestly, studying even as you walk to school?

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.210
You could run into a telephone pole, you know.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:16.970
It definitely wasn't a telephone 
pole that just ran into me.

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:21.220
What's this?

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:24.270
My speech for graduation.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:25.940
That must be a lot of work.

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:28.990
You said it. You're gonna be 
cleaning up all by yourself...

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:30.580
after the graduation ceremony.

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:32.730
Kanamecchi, what did you 
do to deserve that?

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:34.510
That's not what I'm doing.

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:37.780
Incumbent student rep: 
Tsukahara Kaname.

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:40.730
Now, this school will be ours.

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:41.990
Who the hell says that?

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:46.750
I feel like I'm going to trip over 
all the words I don't usually use.

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:48.740
You can do it.

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:17.960
You're not going to wear this jacket to 
the graduation ceremony, are you?

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:21.170
Of course not. I know better.

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:23.260
I'm gonna look sharp at the ceremony.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:27.730
I've never seen you looking sharp.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:36.090
That was close.

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:37.830
That wasn't close.

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:39.690
He caught you.

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:42.730
You do seem like you'd wear that...

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:44.870
to the graduation ceremony 
if he hadn't warned you.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:47.520
I can see why he felt the need to do it.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.700
But this jacket's my look.

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:52.250
No one cares.

00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:55.780
Anyway, the graduation ceremony...

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:57.960
has nothing to do with us.

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:01.040
That's not true.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:04.280
After the ceremony, first and 
second years present flowers...

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:07.330
to graduating members of their clubs.

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:08.970
Invent flowers?

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:12.040
No, Shun-chan, you're the only one who can...

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.260
pull flowers out of thin air at will.

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:14.230
<i>Present</i> flowers.

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:17.560
Well, you're not in any clubs,

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.820
so that doesn't really have 
anything to do with you, either.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.760
It was really interesting.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.310
Really?

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:26.240
By the way, I haven't seen Masaki around lately.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.860
You're right.

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:30.780
Maybe you just haven't seen 
her because she's so short.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:31.750
What's wrong?

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:37.080
There she is.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:39.090
Masaki.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:42.290
Huh?

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:43.170
Hey.

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.810
Chizuru's got biscuits.

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:48.020
Come over here.

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:53.180
Stop that.

00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:58.510
Why did you pretend not to hear us?

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:02.310
You should never turn down sweets. 
Isn't that right, Chizuru?

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:05.150
Chizuru?

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:07.300
What's wrong?

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.200
Um, nothing.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.700
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:17.210
Hey, Mary. Morning.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.290
Do you want some biscuits?

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:23.030
Here, take a handful.

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:23.840
Here.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:30.180
Oh, right. There should be 
some shaped like sheep in here.

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:36.000
What are you doing?

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.140
Are you okay?

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:39.370
I'll go get a dustpan and broom.

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:40.860
Oh, okay.

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.070
Mary, it's okay.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.170
Some of them survived.

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:49.550
Here, you can have them.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:51.870
It's fine.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.060
It's fine.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:09.260
<i>Since that day, I haven't
 really spoken to Mary.</i>

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.870
<i>I like you, Mary.</i>

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:20.360
<i>What's Mary's problem?</i>

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:24.140
<i>I know it's my fault,</i>

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:29.030
<i>but for her to be so obvious
 about avoiding me... It's just...</i>

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:34.790
<i>Just...</i>

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:44.680
A picture?

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:47.420
We're graduating soon.

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.500
We want one to remember them by.

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.550
Are you seriously asking 
him to do this?

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.280
It'll be fine.

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:55.480
Just take a picture...

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:58.670
of Asaba Yuta-kun and 
Yuki-kun acting normal.

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:00.060
Okay?

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.760
Amazing!

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:07.570
Um...

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:09.570
Leave it to me!

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:15.700
I'll get a bunch of shots 
that'll put the pros to shame!

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:20.210
We just want normal ones...

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:21.430
Yutan.

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:23.310
Look! Look over here!

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:25.090
Yukki, you too!

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:28.740
Nice, nice, nice.

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:29.940
Thank you!

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:35.150
Yuta, why is he taking our picture?

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:39.210
Who knows? Chizuru, why are you...

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:40.380
Hey, come on.

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:43.490
You think you're celebrities just 
because you've got a little popularity?

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:48.400
Stop being so sensitive just 
because girls like you.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:51.380
Chizuru-kun, you're 
the one being sensitive.

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:53.510
Prepare yourselves.

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:55.730
Cameraman Chizuru's going to expose...

00:07:55.730 --> 00:08:00.480
the true faces hiding 
behind your smiling facades.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:01.760
How terrifying.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.630
Huh? Behind what?

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:06.210
Let's see...

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:12.700
Yutan, yours came out pretty good,

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:16.890
but you seem almost too nice.
It's like something's missing.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:19.990
Try giving my viewfinder a sense...

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:25.180
of overwhelming negativity to work with.

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:26.960
Very well.

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:29.210
That hand gesture is extremely annoying.

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:30.480
It's that hair.

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:31.990
What?

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:34.570
Try messing up your hair a little.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:35.890
A little styling wax...

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:37.520
Hey, Chizuru...

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:39.590
Try messing up your shirt, too.

00:08:39.590 --> 00:08:40.740
Hey, Yuki-kun.

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:55.190
Good. That's good, Yutan!

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:58.220
You're a super handsome man now!

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:03.730
This hair just looks like 
wet seaweed to me.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.550
Okay, you're next, Yukki!

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:08.980
And then, it's Kanamecchi!

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:10.690
What? Why me?

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:13.580
Our theme is: The school's biggest thug...

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:14.950
and the class president!

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:21.470
Like this?

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:23.480
No, no, no!

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:27.080
The theme is the school's biggest 
thug and the class president.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:30.770
You've got to show more 
animosity for each other.

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:31.880
Then...

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.450
"Then," nothing!

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.460
Don't actually try to hit me!

00:09:35.460 --> 00:09:39.490
I'm just going to gently 
pretend to punch you.

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:41.060
It'll be fine.

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:43.470
You won't even have to worry 
about your glasses breaking.

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:45.850
You're planning to punch 
me right in the face!

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:49.980
Kaname, you're hitting 
harder than anyone else.

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:59.930
<i>I can't believe I ran away like that.</i>

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:01.960
<i>They probably think I'm weird.</i>

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:05.060
Okay, Shun-chan, you're next.

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:06.500
Try acting a little naughty.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.370
That's straight up dirty.

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:10.710
My head's all sticky.

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:13.750
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.390
<i>I could go around that way...</i>

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:19.490
<i>But then, it'd be obvious 
that I'm avoiding them.</i>

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:22.050
<i>I should go this way...</i>

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:26.230
<i>But I don't know what 
expression I should make.</i>

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:36.920
Oh, it's Mary.

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:40.730
What's up? Is your class going somewhere?

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:43.730
I'm a cameraman now.

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:45.360
Do you want me to take 
your picture, Mary?

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:47.580
N-No, I'm fine.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:50.530
I see. I guess class is about to start.

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:52.160
Well...

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:54.740
I'll take a picture of the two of you.

00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:55.760
Huh?

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:58.050
Okay, okay. Stand next to each other.

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:00.550
What? No, you don't have to—

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:03.100
Okay, substituting the cameraman.

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:06.600
<i>Okay? This isn't okay!</i>

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:12.030
Peace!

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:14.700
Come on, make a peace sign, Mary.

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:16.860
My hands are full.

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:19.780
Then, smile.

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.610
Come on, smile.

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:23.530
I can't.

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:25.120
My hands are full.

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:28.090
You don't need your hands to smile!

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:29.860
Who cares what I do?

00:11:29.860 --> 00:11:32.300
He's trying to take our picture,

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:34.040
so put some feeling into it!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.960
Check your hair in a 
mirror or something.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:39.030
Shut up. You're one to talk.

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:41.470
You should look at your 
own hair in the mirror.

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:44.160
My hair's got nothing to do with this!

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:45.230
You never give up.

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:46.740
It's always this and that!

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:48.800
You don't have to tell 
me to make a peace sign!

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:50.610
Okay, okay, fine.

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:53.010
I'm sorry, I'm sure.

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:04.030
<i>I talked to him.</i>

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:06.160
How long are you two going to fight?

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:07.030
I'm taking the picture.

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:10.080
Say: "Cheese."

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:12.500
<i>Oh, no.</i>

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:14.540
<i>I blinked.</i>

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:16.670
I'll take another one.

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.050
Huh? Another?

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:20.440
Just in case.

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:25.790
Yuki, you're taking too many.

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:28.140
<i>What an embarrassing picture.</i>

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:31.340
<i>Well, it's not like anyone will see it.</i>

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:33.670
How did it turn out?

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:36.090
We should be able to see it soon.

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:38.380
How exciting.

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:45.970
Mary?

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:46.880
What's with her?

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:47.890
Mary!

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:49.580
Hey, wait! Mary!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.870
Mary, wait!

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:52.910
Mary!

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:55.780
What are you doing?

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:55.780
No!

00:12:55.780 --> 00:12:57.320
Let go!

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:59.430
Everyone's supposed to look at it together.

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:00.450
Hey.

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:01.710
No!

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:03.780
Why are you being so stubborn?

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:06.090
Because I blinked!

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.390
I bet my face looks weird!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:09.570
Huh? You blinked?

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:11.240
Now we've really gotta see it—

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:12.600
No! Don't!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:14.600
I don't want Shun-chan to see it!

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:43.360
Well, I don't think you should show that...

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:46.260
to anyone, not just Shun-chan.

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.060
They'd all laugh.

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.350
Shut up.

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:25.920
<i>I don't want Shun-chan to see it!</i>

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:47.610
<i>Mary's head is always filled 
with thoughts of Shun-chan.</i>

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:50.900
<i>Only Shun-chan.</i>

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:55.250
<i>Always...</i>

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.660
<i>Always...</i>

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:14.820
Today, each one of you will spread...

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:18.660
your wings and leave this school...

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:25.220
in pur... pursuit... in 
pursuit of your dreams.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:28.940
We will keep that image in our hearts,

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.950
as the rest of us stay here 
and continue our studies.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:34.450
<b>42nd Homare High School 
Graduation Ceremony</b>

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:38.070
In closing, I wish you all the 
best of health, happiness,

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:40.540
and success as you leave our school.

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:43.250
Thank you for everything.

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:46.420
Current student representative: 
Tsukahara Kaname.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.030
<i>What am I going to do?</i>

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:53.580
<i>Maybe I really should give it back.</i>

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:58.890
<i>I accidentally took the picture 
where my eyes are open.</i>

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:01.460
Now for the response from 
the graduating students.

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:02.620
<i>Idiot.</i>

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:05.940
Graduating student rep: 
Ohno Isao-kun.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.640
Yes.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.640
Kanamecchi stuttered, didn't he?

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:10.900
Huh? I wasn't listening.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:15.040
<i>I even managed to talk to him normally.</i>

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:18.290
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:19.960
Tachibana.

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:23.250
The cherry blossoms grow 
bigger by the day,

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:24.660
Oh, this is...

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:27.120
and on this day, when we 
feel the coming of spring...

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.520
See me after this is over.

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:30.100
because of the warm sun's rays,

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:28.640
But...

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.670
You have my sympathy.

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:33.340
we thank you for this grand ceremony.

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:34.190
<i>Idiot.</i>

00:16:36.380 --> 00:16:40.420
Also, we thank you for the 
warm and memorable messages...

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:47.130
from the principal, our guests, and 
the current student representative.

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:50.440
Thank you again.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:56.200
Three years ago, when we passed 
through this school's gates...

00:16:57.270 --> 00:17:04.270
This concludes the 42nd Homare 
High School graduation ceremony.

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:09.590
<i>I'll put it in his locker.</i>

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.880
<i>He'll have to notice it then.</i>

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:14.840
Oh, sorry.

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:19.190
E-Excuse me, I...

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.490
Ouch...

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:29.340
Excuse me.

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:30.880
Please let me through.

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:39.620
Why are you stumbling around, Mary?

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:42.400
Are you okay?

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:44.500
Hey, Tachibana.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:46.140
Oh, crap.

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:48.290
I told you to come see 
me after the ceremony.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.650
Oh, I...

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:55.860
Hey, Tachibana!

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:58.180
Sorry! I'll come see you later!

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:16.130
What a nice ceremony.

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:18.300
What, you mean Kaname's stuttering speech?

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:19.640
Shut up.

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:21.950
Hey, where's Chizuru?

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:26.790
The guidance counselor 
went like this, and this.

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.030
So this, did this, and this.

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:30.830
Right.

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:32.480
No, he didn't.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.320
We should hurry.

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:37.640
The graduates are leaving.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:42.600
Hurry up.

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:44.640
They're leaving.

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:46.320
Wait, wait.

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:48.810
I wonder if they'll cry.

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:53.390
You took the wrong photo, didn't you?

00:18:57.680 --> 00:18:58.780
Here it is.

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.490
You really did blink.

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:03.820
What a funny face.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:06.450
Here.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:19.510
You really made a weird face.

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:23.270
I can see why you wouldn't 
want him to see this.

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:31.900
I wonder if the third years 
are coming out soon.

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:34.360
What...

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:38.830
What should I do?

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:45.740
How should I act?

00:20:02.190 --> 00:20:03.890
Act like you always have.

00:20:05.710 --> 00:20:08.020
I wasn't asking you for an answer,

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:10.220
and I know you like Shun-chan.

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:12.780
The thing I'd hate most is for you...

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:14.190
to stop talking to me altogether.

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:15.710
So...

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:16.690
Yeah.

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:18.280
Just keep...

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.450
acting like you always have.

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:27.620
But what exactly do you mean 
by "like I always have"?

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.970
Does that mean I can accept 
biscuits when you offer them?

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:31.710
Oh, come off it!

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:34.240
I don't know all the specifics!

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:35.680
What should you do?

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:37.440
Why are you asking me?!

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:39.340
B-Because...

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:46.760
Because I really don't know.

00:20:48.090 --> 00:20:51.940
No matter how much I think 
about it, I don't know.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:53.730
Mary...

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:57.490
During class, while eating,

00:20:57.490 --> 00:21:01.910
when I'm in the bath, 
after I've gotten into bed.

00:21:01.910 --> 00:21:05.910
I can't stop thinking 
about what I should do.

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:08.870
It's all I think about.

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:20.510
Why are you laughing?

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:23.080
I'm not laughing.

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:24.190
You are!

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:25.370
I'm not laughing.

00:21:25.370 --> 00:21:28.330
You... are.

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:31.970
I'm not.

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:36.560
<i>Even if it was just a little...</i>

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:42.700
<i>Even if it was only for a little while, 
she did think about me a lot.</i>

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:46.740
<i>She filled her head with thoughts of me.</i>

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:54.040
<i>That's enough...</i>

00:21:58.770 --> 00:22:00.560
Congratulations.

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:02.590
A picture! Can we get a picture?

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:04.930
It's Shun-chan and the others.

00:22:04.930 --> 00:22:06.050
Hey!

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:09.790
Yukki ignored me.

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:11.530
Hey, Yukki!

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:17.560
<i>The flowers are blooming.</i>

00:22:18.880 --> 00:22:20.760
<i>Buds are appearing on the cherry trees.</i>

00:22:24.830 --> 00:22:27.540
<i>Spring will soon be here.</i>

00:24:16.160 --> 00:24:19.530
The next episode is "Sugar Baby, Fly Baby."
